1
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,200
If I...

2
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,300
If I shatter this... it'll all...

3
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:33,800
Kyle?

4
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,000
I can't do it.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,400
Even if it's to save the world,
I can't kill you.

6
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:45,000
I... I just can't!

7
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,100
Kyle...

8
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:59,500
Please, Reala. Just say it.
Just one word.

9
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:04,200
Tell me you don't want to disappear!
Please, Reala!

10
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,500
Kyle... I'm not afraid of disappearing.

11
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:19,800
What frightens me is vanishing like this,
as part of a god.

12
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:29,000
But if you shatter the Lens and set me free,
then perhaps, when I'm born again...

13
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:34,400
...I can meet you again,
as a human just like you.

14
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:38,900
So... Kyle! Shatter the Lens!

15
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:15,700
You chose destruction.

16
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:18,700
Even after all you've done...

17
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:22,000
What kind of hero can't save one girl?

18
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,700
You idiot! Save her!

19
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:27,500
I want to save Reala!

20
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:30,000
I don't want to disappear...

21
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:38,700
Are you suffering? In pain? In sorrow?
God alone can save people from such torment.

22
00:02:38,700 --> 00:02:43,700
But you killed that God.

23
00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:50,700
Never again will you know peace.
A tomorrow filled with love and prosperity will never come.

24
00:02:50,700 --> 00:02:51,800
Wrong.

25
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:55,800
Without God's guidance, you have no future.

26
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,900
Wrong.

27
00:02:56,900 --> 00:03:03,700
It is not too late. Pray to God. Seek God.
God will heal everything...

28
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:10,700
...even the suffering of a great sinner like you.
That is the ultimate wish of humankind.

29
00:03:10,700 --> 00:03:13,800
Wrong!

30
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:20,800
This pain in my heart—this suffering—is mine.
Even God can't heal it.

31
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:23,800
I won't let it be healed!

32
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:33,700
That's why a God we can ask for everything
and entrust everything to must not exist.

33
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:37,800
Our future isn't yours to make.

34
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:42,800
The future is here.
It starts here!

35
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,800
Disappear!

36
00:03:54,600 --> 00:04:01,700
Yes. The threads of time leading to the future
are spun by human hands.

37
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:05,700
And that is why infinite possibilities are born.

38
00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:07,700
Reala!

39
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:08,700
Kyle!

40
00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:11,800
Reala! I... I...

41
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:22,700
That's why I believe.
I believe in the future you will create...

42
00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:29,700
...the future where I meet you.
I believe in it. That's why I...

43
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,200
Reala!

44
00:04:35,300 --> 00:04:40,900
Thank you, Kyle.
I'm so glad I met you...

45
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:51,300
Reala...
